  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality , Health,livelihoods and Nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland supports vulnerable women and girls including those affected by COVID-19 and climate-induced drought in rebuilding livelihoods, improving food security and avoiding negative coping mechanisms, stigma, discrimination and harmful practices such as child/forced marriage, gender based violence or sex work through an NGO consortium led by Save the Children International. We also work with UN partners to strengthen institutional capacity and legal frameworks for gender equality. We will work with ODI to generate evidence on underlying constraints to gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 4: Gender equality is advanced through women and girls realising their rights, living healthier lives and accessing productive resources</narrative>
  </description>
